    "title": "Coachella 2026 lineup: Justin Bieber, Sabrina Carpenter performing",
    "text": "April 9, 2026, 8:01 a.m. ETCoachella is back starting this weekend, bringing some of the world's most talented musical artists to the Empire Polo Club in Indio, California.The headliners for the festival are Sabrina Carpenter, Justin Bieber and Karol G. Carpenter is riding the momentum of her recent video for House Tour, which co-starred Margaret Qualley and Madelyn Cline. Bieber was recently spotted by fans rehearsing for his set, giving clues as to what he'll perform. Karol G, meanwhile, is making history as the first Latina to headline the festival.So, there are your headliners. Here's who'll be joining them in a star-studded lineup set to perform this weekend and the next.Coachella 2026 lineup&friends54 UltraAddison RaeAdriatiqueAfrojack x ShimzaAlex GAnymaArmin Van Buuren x Adam BeyerArodesAzzeccaBedouinBen SterlingBiaBigBangBiniBlack FlagBlondshellBlood OrangeBob Baker MarionettesBoys NoizeBunt.Cachirula & LoojanCahuilla Bird Singers and DancersCarlita x Josh BakerCarolina DuranteCentral CeeCeremonyChloe Caillet x Rossi.ClipseCMATCobrahCreepy NutsDabeullDarcoDavid ByrneDavid GuettaDavidoDeep DishDevaultDevoDie SpitzDijonDisclosureDisco LinesDJ Snake x Knock2DJ Snake x RL Grime x FlosstradamusDJ Snake's Pardon my FrenchDoom DaveDrainDuke DumontEcca VandalEthel CainFakeminkFatboy SlimFebruaryFKA TwigsFleshwaterFlowerovloveFoster the PeopleFranky RizardoFreak SlugFrench PoliceFuji KazeGabe RealGeeseGenesiGigi PerezGirl Math (Vnssa x Nala)GiveonGlittererGordoGreen Velvet x AyyboGroove Armada (DJ set)HamdiHolly HumberstoneHot MulliganHugelIggy PopInterpolJack WhiteJane RemoverJaqck GlamJazzyJessica BrankkaJoeziJoostJoy (Anonymous)Joyce ManorJuicewonJustin BieberKarol GKaskadeKatseyeKettamaLabrinthLaufeyLe YoraLevityLinksaLittle SimzLobomanLos Hermanos FloresLos RetrosLP GiobbiLuisa SonzaLykke LiMadeonMahmut OrhanMajor LazerMarlon HoffstadtMassioMax Dean x Luke DeanMax StylerMind EnterprisesMobyMochakkModel/ActrizMoratMestizaNewdadNinjarachiNine Inch No